{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302230","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130223001:1":{"text":"하지만 이번 군가 축제에서 둘이 엄청난 존재감을 드러냈어. 다크호스의 화려한 등장이었지.","source_cn":"但是却杀出两匹黑马，在战歌节中脱颖而出。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD65AB4483392D7A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130223002:1":{"text":"특히 아르사의 구르기 공격은 정말 인상적이었어!","source_cn":"尤其是阿尔萨滚动攻击，令我印象深刻！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0525B104CFF26B27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130223003:1":{"text":"보는 재미도 있었고 위력도 굉장했지.","source_cn":"真是非常有趣且强力的攻击方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B91FB09B54A1139","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血迪拉夫":{"text":"딜라프","source":"蛮血迪拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}